      "message": "What\u0027s your opinion on this patch?\n\nI also considered adding a `SkStackAllocated` base class. The issues would be this forces aggregate initialization to initialize the empty base class. E.g: `x \u003d {arg1, arg2}`, becomes `x \u003d {{}, arg1, arg2}`, which I disliked.\n\nFollow-up patches using it:\n- Graphite: https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/1391096\n- Ganesh: https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/1391116\n- Core: https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/1391136",
